      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa 27 ogwa Yeroboamu omukama wa Isiraeli, Azaria eya Amazia, omukama wa Yuda abanza kutwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugya kulya engoma akaba aina emyaka 16, mara aha ngoma akamaraho emyaka 52 ayemire Yerusalemu. Nyina eibaralye ni Yekolia owa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akashemeleza Omukama nk'okwo Amazia, ishe, yagizire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai obuju bw'aha mabanga tibwarugiremu. Abantu bakagendelera kubutambiramu ebitambo n'okubwoteramu obunuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akabonabonyia Azaria, yamubembesa kulemwa kuhika aha kufakwe; yaturaga omu njuye wenkai. Omutabani Yotamu niwe yamanyaga eka; n'abanyansi niwe yabageleraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byona ebyo Azaria yakozire bihandikirwe omu Kitabo ky'Amakuru g'Abakama ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaria atahya, bamubyalira omu Kigo kya Daudi omu magashani ga baishe. Omutabani Yotamu alya engoma, amusikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa makumi gashatu na munana Azaria omukama wa Yuda aliire engoma, Zekaria eya Yeroboamu atwara Isiraeli ayemire Samaria, akatwara emyezi mukaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagokera Omukama nka baishe, tiyayelinzire mafu ga Yeroboamu eya Nebati ago yafakaize Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu mutabani wa Yabeshi amubanja, amwitira Ibuleamu, amwihya aha ngoma, agilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi ebyo Zekaria yakozire, leba bihandikirwe omu Kitabo ky'Amakuru g'Abakama ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Omukama akashangwa araganisize Yehu ati, “Batabani bawe balilya engoma ya Isiraeli kuturuka aha muzarwa gwa kanai.” Mara nikwo byabaire.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
