        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa 50 Azaria omukama wa Yuda alire engoma, Pekayia eya Menahemu abanza kutwara Isiraeli ayemire Samaria; akatwara emyaka ebili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
