          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagokera Omukama, tiyayelinzire mafu ga Yeroboamu eya Nebati, ago yafakaize Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nirwo Peka eya Remalia, omukuru w'eihelye, yayemire n'Abagileadi akamushenga. Akamwitira Samaria omu kikaare omu buhungiro. Akamwita yamwihya aha ngoma, yagilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
